<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>英语-VICE</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:35:18 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>3 首被过度播放的 EDM 歌曲，其实值得大肆宣传</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-overplayed-edm-songs-that-actually-deserve-the-hype/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这三首 EDM 歌曲可能被夸大了，但它们确实值得大肆宣传，因为它们继续在音乐节上占据主导地位。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;后&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-overplayed-edm-songs-that-actually-deserve-the-hype/"&gt;3 首过度播放的 EDM 歌曲实际上值得炒作&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 23:33:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-overplayed-edm-songs-that-actually-deserve-the-hype/</guid></item><item><title>Nirvana 的《Lithium》的演绎是我听过的最美丽、最具变革性的翻唱歌曲之一</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/this-rendition-of-nirvanas-lithium-is-one-of-the-most-beautiful-and-transformative-cover-songs-ive-ever-heard/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在 BBC 现场表演中，菲比·布里杰斯 (Phoebe Bridgers) 翻唱了令人难以置信的 Nirvana 歌曲，轻松跻身有史以来最好的垃圾摇滚表演之列。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/this-rendition-of-nirvanas-lithium-is-one-of-the-most-beautiful-and-transformative-cover-songs-ive-ever-heard/"&gt;Nirvana 的“Lithium”的演绎是我听过的最美丽、最具变革性的翻唱歌曲之一，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 22:31:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/this-rendition-of-nirvanas-lithium-is-one-of-the-most-beautiful-and-transformative-cover-songs-ive-ever-heard/</guid></item><item><title>传奇金属吉他手分享癌症诊断最新消息：“我觉得它会杀了我”</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/legendary-metal-guitarist-shares-cancer-diagnosis-update-i-felt-it-was-going-to-kill-me/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;长期硬摇滚和金属吉他手 Vivian Campbell（DIO、Def Leppard）透露，他的癌症在手术失败后又复发了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/legendary-metal-guitarist-shares-cancer-diagnosis-update-i-felt-it-was-going-to-kill-me/"&gt;传奇金属吉他手分享癌症诊断最新消息：“我感觉它要杀了我”&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 22:26:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/legendary-metal-guitarist-shares-cancer-diagnosis-update-i-felt-it-was-going-to-kill-me/</guid></item><item><title>《龙与地下城》揭示了三个新的幽暗地域主题子类别</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/dungeons-and-dragons-reveals-three-new-underdark-themed-subclasses/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;《龙与地下城》玩家现在可以通过今天推出的三个独特的新子类别潜入幽暗地域。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/dungeons-and-dragons-reveals-three-new-underdark-themed-subclasses/"&gt;《龙与地下城》发布后揭示了三个新的幽暗地域主题子类别，该子类别&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 19:18:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/dungeons-and-dragons-reveals-three-new-underdark-themed-subclasses/</guid></item><item><title>观看：Yungblud 将断腿放在嘴上，然后坐在轮椅上进行人群冲浪</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/watch-yungblud-puts-his-broken-leg-where-his-mouth-is-and-goes-wheelchair-crowdsurfing/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;永布卢德（Yungblud）的腿受伤了，也许应该取消即将举行的音乐会，但他却登上了舞台，坐在轮椅上进行了人群冲浪。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;帖子&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/watch-yungblud-puts-his-broken-leg-where-his-mouth-is-and-goes-wheelchair-crowdsurfing/"&gt;《观看：Yungblud 将断腿放到嘴里，然后坐在轮椅上进行人群冲浪》&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 18:49:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/watch-yungblud-puts-his-broken-leg-where-his-mouth-is-and-goes-wheelchair-crowdsurfing/</guid></item><item><title>Timbaland 因 Missy Elliott 巡演改组而被控裙带关系，诉讼金额达六位数</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/timbaland-accused-of-nepotism-in-six-figure-lawsuit-over-missy-elliott-tour-shakeup/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Timbaland 面临一项诉讼，指控他解雇了一名 DJ 以雇用儿子进行巡演，但他将责任归咎于他的前经理。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/timbaland-accused-of-nepotism-in-six-figure-lawsuit-over-missy-elliott-tour-shakeup/"&gt;Timbaland 因 Missy Elliott 巡回演唱会改组而被指控在六位数诉讼中裙带关系，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 18:10:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/timbaland-accused-of-nepotism-in-six-figure-lawsuit-over-missy-elliott-tour-shakeup/</guid></item><item><title>这位女主角“讽刺地”重新发行了她 2001 年失败电影的原声带，我们和她一样感到惊讶</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/this-diva-is-unironically-reissuing-the-soundtrack-to-her-2001-film-flop-and-were-just-as-surprised-as-her/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;玛丽亚·凯莉 (Mariah Carey) 正在重新发行她 2001 年电影《Glitter》的原声带，该片在发行后收视率很差。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;这篇文章&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/this-diva-is-unironically-reissuing-the-soundtrack-to-her-2001-film-flop-and-were-just-as-surprised-as-her/"&gt;“这位女主角”“讽刺地”重新发行了她 2001 年失败电影的原声带，我们和她一样惊讶，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 18:04:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/this-diva-is-unironically-reissuing-the-soundtrack-to-her-2001-film-flop-and-were-just-as-surprised-as-her/</guid></item><item><title>《我的世界地下城 2》游戏预告片确认了新维度</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/minecraft-dungeons-2-gameplay-trailer-confirms-new-dimension/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;《我的世界地下城 2》发布了一个新预告片，揭示了游戏的神秘维度，并让我们更仔细地了解游戏玩法。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/minecraft-dungeons-2-gameplay-trailer-confirms-new-dimension/"&gt;《我的世界地下城 2》游戏预告片确认了新维度，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 17:31:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/minecraft-dungeons-2-gameplay-trailer-confirms-new-dimension/</guid></item><item><title>Roll20 确认《龙与地下城》新功能即将推出</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/roll20-confirms-new-dungeons-and-dragons-features-rolling-out-soon/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;流行的 Roll20 虚拟桌面刚刚宣布对该平台的龙与地下城工具进行了一些令人兴奋的更新。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/roll20-confirms-new-dungeons-and-dragons-features-rolling-out-soon/"&gt;Roll20 后确认《龙与地下城》新功能即将推出&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 17:11:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/roll20-confirms-new-dungeons-and-dragons-features-rolling-out-soon/</guid></item><item><title>如果你做这些事情，你可能会不小心欺骗你的伴侣</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/if-you-do-these-things-you-might-be-accidentally-cheating-on-your-partner/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;大多数人认为他们非常清楚什么是作弊。显然，与关系之外的人有身体接触。当然是情感上的事情。然而，普通美国人的定义已经变得更加具体——而且人们一直在做符合这个定义的事情。 Talker Research 在 2026 年对 2,000 名美国人进行了调查，[…]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/if-you-do-these-things-you-might-be-accidentally-cheating-on-your-partner/"&gt;如果你做了这些事情，你可能会不小心欺骗你的伴侣，&lt;/a&gt;这篇文章首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 16:36:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/if-you-do-these-things-you-might-be-accidentally-cheating-on-your-partner/</guid></item></channel></rss>